OL,3,GNEWSACoul Links golf course plan
OL,4,Arejected again by Scottish ministers
OL,5,
OL,6,FControversial plans to build a golf
OL,7,Fcourse in Sutherland have been rejected
OL,8,Ffor a second time by Scottish
OL,9,Fministers.
OL,11,FPlans to develop Coul Links at Embo,
OL,12,Fnear Dornoch, were previously refused
OL,13,Fin 2020 and now a revised proposal has
OL,14,Falso been turned down.
OL,16,FMinisters said the proposed 18-hold
OL,17,Fcourse, which was approved by Highland
OL,18,FCouncil three years ago, would have a
OL,19,Fsignificant adverse effect on
OL,20,Fnationally and internationally
OL,21,Fimportant habitats and species.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
