OL,3,GNEWSACoul Links golf course plan
OL,4,Arejected again by Scottish ministers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision has been welcomed by a
OL,7,Fcoalition of conservation charities but
OL,8,Fthe group behind the plan, Communities
OL,9,Ffor Coul, said it was a "huge blow for
OL,10,Fthe area".
